# Extended regexes that must match NOTHING in any file of a public branch, in any commit (checked by push_clean.sh after the strip).
/Users/[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+
Documents/pca-release-key[s]
\.pca-signin[g]
Desktop/rokid/backups/key[s]
BEGIN (RSA |EC |DSA |OPENSSH |ENCRYPTED )?PRIVATE KEY
AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16}
gh[pousr]_[A-Za-z0-9]{30,}
sk-[A-Za-z0-9_-]{32,}
AIza[0-9A-Za-z_-]{35}
